+## Branch `megakernel`, iteration 8: measured on the 3090 (evira), glue made bit-exact, the stages ranked
+
+The branch now builds and runs on the GPU host (dev container `inkdev`, sources in /data/inkling/dev-src, image
+`llamacpp-inkling2mini:dev` = the published runtime image with the dev binaries; `/data/inkling/dev-image/{make,check}.sh`,
+`scripts/mk-bench.sh` with `IMAGE=llamacpp-inkling2mini:dev`). Loop bug of rev 7: `LLAMA_INKLING_SHARE_LOOP_KV`, not a stage.
