+Deep-context attention switches, measured (mk-bench, glue on in every row; short / 54K tok/s): glue 94.7 / 75.6;
+`LLAMA_INKLING_FA_VEC_GQA=1` 92.3 / 77.3 (+2.3% at 54K, -2.5% at short context); `LLAMA_INKLING_NO_MASK=1` 96.0 / 75.7
+(+1% short, 0 at depth); both 92.1 / 77.4. The short-to-54K loss (~2.5 ms/token) is attention time, but the KV read
