+non-bit-exactness in the output distribution. No stage is at fault. cuBLAS's order for the odd-count product is a
+multiply-then-add chain in ascending k for n_q = 3 and 4 (0 of 7 M elements differ, k 3..11, `mixblas-exp.cu`), but
+for n_q = 1 (the SWA attention mixes and every FFN mix) its gemv kernel reduces in an order none of the simple chains
+reproduce; an exact odd-count MIX is therefore only possible for the 8 full-attention mixes of a token.
